Trace the way into bsd_init()

The boot stops inside machine_lockdown() and nothing after it reaches the
framebuffer console. Print the entry of bsd_init() so the next stall can be
told apart from a stall in the lockdown itself.

--- a/osfmk/kern/startup.c
+++ b/osfmk/kern/startup.c
@@ -788,3 +789,4 @@
 #ifdef  MACH_BSD
+	printf("TULIP BOOT: before bsd_init\n");
 	bsd_init();
 #endif
